mais ou menos intensas.', 199.9, 168.9, NULL, 'Home & Living > Decoration > Table Cloths', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/br-11134207-7r98o-m857piu2zd9t6a', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F776725570%2F25393502506', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
