cluindo o esporte.', 225.86, 82.3, NULL, 'Computers & Accessories > Keyboards & Mice > Keyboards', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/br-11134207-820l7-mqeqor4n0f7k82', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F627750190%2F23394342239', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
