ele^nio, sulfato de cobre, sulfato de ferro, sulfato de mangane^s, sulfato de zinco, zinco aminoa´cido quelato.', 67.9, 67.9, NULL, 'Pets > Pet Food > Cat Food', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-825af-mgcredqthyx450', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F645931940%2F58250082034', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
