is VONDER agora mesmo!', 1198.71, 904.54, NULL, 'Home & Living > Tools & Home Improvement > Tools', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-7reou-m8z0xhyvzqm705', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F939446263%2F22098660263', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
